          "description": "Tracks progressive housing condition deterioration from sound baseline through hazardous conditions. Sustained deterioration across multiple housing dimensions (temp + structural + air quality) escalates to UNSAFE_HOUSING, indicating conditions that drive health outcomes worse than chronic illness alone.",
          "path": "SOUND+ \u2192 DETERIORATING \u2192 HAZARDOUS \u2192 output[1,0,0,0]",
